{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Pantry Snap Pro 是一套以本地資料為先的食材管理工具，適合經常買入食材卻忘記使用、最終白白丟棄的人。你可以手動新增食物、掃描條碼、拍攝包裝標籤與到期日，把儲物櫃、雪櫃與冷藏櫃內的物品整理成可搜尋的清單。軟件原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-214.webp\">\n<h2>過期預測與七日煮食計劃</h2>\n<p>App 會按到期時間、存放位置與優先分數排列急需處理的食材，並提供七日救援預測，提示本週要先處理的食物。內建 799 個離線食譜可與現有材料配對菜式，把即將過期的食材優先排入晚餐計劃，缺少材料會自動合併成採購清單；批次計劃則把到期檢查、優先烹調與預備冷凍分成實際路線。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-373-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-374-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-375-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-376-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-377-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-378-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Pantry Snap Pro: Food Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T19:39:39.095814+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":344,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:24:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T13:58:13.803038+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T19:37:43.464128+00:00","content_hash":"821b56d7a923425c658b7fea2aab09c065411a2755a001f08685c70b9ca95838","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}